          }
        },
        "entry_4ibth3": {
          "type": "entry",
          "settings": {
            "full_width_enable": false,
            "title": "What are the benefits of mulching?",
            "text": "<p>Mulching your grass clippings can have a significant impact on the amount of fertiliser needed to keep a lawn looking good. This reduces the need for additional fertilisers, although it may not be a bad idea to give the lawn a boost in early spring after a long winter without cutting.  Mulching also helps retain moisture in dry, hot weather, protecting the lawn from scorching.</p>",
            "button_1_style": "white",
            "button_1_text": "",
            "button_1_url": "",
            "button_2_style": "white",
            "button_2_text": "",
            "button_2_url": "",
